{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有：Y在S01、S05这类短停留段同时出现多句叙事和多组感受词，扫读压力明显大于X，部分内容来不及消化。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"X\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"Y最突出的优势是把心理变化拆得更清楚，重点词突出后，观众能迅速抓住每段的情绪落点；同时，感受词与音乐进程结合得更细，既有身体感受，也有心理活动和音乐质感，前后还能形成连续的情绪变化。X更轻巧、叙事更顺口，但压缩掉了一些重要的心理动机和细腻层次。综合而言，我选Y，尽管它需要控制短屏的信息密度。\"}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "04f8d1e1-44a1-48e6-9626-b58c10aad221", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T163541598196Z", "elapsed_seconds": 124.344, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T16:37:45.943410+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "11dfce655603e840667ac0202a67c54947379d086bf75f5bd9560dd3b03c1f79", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "scree